        {
          "text": "Here are two great coffee shops within easy walking distance in the Xinyi area:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Fake Sober Taipei**\n* **Address:** No. 20, Songshou Rd, Xinyi District, Taipei City\n* **Why go:** \n  * **Vibrant, relaxed vibe:** A popular, stylish open-air venue right along Songshou Road that operates as a cafe by day and a craft beer bar by night.\n  * **Creative drinks & quick bites:** Known for well-crafted specialty coffee drinks (such as their signature cloud coffee and Sicilian lemon espresso), alongside fresh salt bread and snacks. It is an easy, casual spot to grab a seat and people-watch.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Fika Fika Cafe (Far Eastern Xinyi A13)**\n* **Address:** B3, No. 58, Songren Rd, Xinyi District, Taipei City\n* **Why go:** \n  * **World-class specialty coffee:** Founded by a Nordic Barista Cup champion, Fika Fika is celebrated for its meticulous light-roast espresso and clean pour-over brews.\n  * **Calm atmosphere & desserts:** Situated on the basement level of Far Eastern A13, it offers a quieter, Scandinavian-style sanctuary from the busy streets. It's a great spot if you want to pair top-tier coffee with artisanal pastries like their popular cinnamon rolls or honey lattes.",
